=== v1.2 ===

    - Release date: 12/16/92
    - Quick SECOND release was needed that incorporated a check for Loss
      of Carrier. I discovered crash city if the user exited the bbs through
      the SYS.END file, but didn't stick around to use SugBox.
    - The request line at the start of the file was removed. This was only
      really needed if the SugBox was added to SYS.END. All the other means
      stated the user WANTED to use the SugBox, so why ASK again.
    - Easily modifyable variables in the beginning of the file to state the
      NAME of your BBS and ALL ID Numbers you wished to give the extended
      commands(KILL and PRIVATE) to.
    - Any suggestion written will also be sent to ID # 1 as a piece of
      personal mail, which can then be replied to if need be.
    - Completed the colorization in the SAVE and PRIVATE menus that I missed
      in v1.0.

=== v1.0 ===

    - First official release of this program. 12/15/92
    - Allows users to leave Suggestions to better your BBS.
    - Suggestions can be PRIVATE(For SYSOPS EYES Only!)
    - Users can VIEW any Suggestions in the box that are NOT Private!
    - SysOp can toggle PRIVATE status and selectively KILL Suggestions.
    - FULL ANSI COLOR / CURSOR MOVEMENT INCLUDED!!!

